],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"opacities"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract32AllOpacitySemanticTokensProviderP","text":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider"}],"languages":["swift"]}]}],"references":{"ic_theme_orange.png":{"type":"image","alt":null,"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/allopacitysemantictokensprovider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Something which provides all semantic tokens of opacity"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Theme Orange","kind":"text"}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"title":"Theme Orange","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component tokens"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for list item components like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSListItem"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSmallListItem"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllListItemComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ListItemComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for list item components through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Such component tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of sizes (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSizeSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"borders (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllBorderSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), colors (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllColorSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":"), opacities (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and dimensions (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"title":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider/opacities":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemelistitemcomponenttokensprovider\/opacities","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of opacity semantic tokens to use for list item opacities"}],"title":"opacities","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"opacities","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllOpacitySemanticTokensProvider","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract32AllOpacitySemanticTokensProviderP"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeListItemComponentTokensProvider\/opacities"}}}